'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|Next to the dorms, there's a sedan with a threatening message left on it. It seems one of the residents had a serious debt. But this Kozlov was probably not the only debtor in the industrial zone. Perhaps he was being hunted for a reason?}}

==Requirements==
Locate the white scribbled-on car in the courtyard of the dormitories on [[Customs]].
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Accidental Witness Map.png|Car location marked on map
File:Accidental Witness Car.png|The wanted car
</gallery></li>

==Objectives==
* Figure out where Kozlov lived
* Read the [[Note for Kozlov|note]] on Kozlov's door
* Find out what Kozlov was involved in
** (''Optional'') Access [[Dorm room 110 key|Kozlov's room]]
** (''Optional'') [[Note from the repair shop|Figure out]] where to get [[Dorm room 110 key|Kozlov's key]]
** (''Optional'') [[Letter from Kozlov's room|Investigate]] [[Dorm room 110 key|Kozlov's room]]
* Ask the traders about Anastasia
* Access [[Skier]]'s [[Zmeisky 3 apartment key|accomplice's apartment]]
** (''Optional'') Find the [[Zmeisky 3 apartment key|key to the apartment]]
* Learn more about [[Skier]]'s accomplice
** (''Optional'') Investigate the apartment
* Read the documents in [[Skier]]'s accomplice's apartment
* Survive and extract from [[Streets of Tarkov]]
* Report to [[Skier]]
* Talk to [[Ragman]]
* Locate Anastasia's apartment
* Learn more about Anastasia
* Investigate the entrance of Anastasia's building
* Locate courier Pasha
* [[Unsealed envelope|Search]] the ambush spot
* Talk to [[Skier]]
* Locate [[Reshala's bunkhouse key|Reshala's stash]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and neutralize [[Reshala]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain the [[Reshala's bunkhouse key|key to Reshala's stash]]
* [[Note with an address|Investigate]] [[Reshala's bunkhouse key|Reshala's bunkhouse]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain [[Note with a warning|Reshala's work notes]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain [[Letter from Reshala's bunkhouse|courier Pasha's belongings]]
* Locate Kozlov's hideout
* Locate and obtain [[Audio tape with incriminating evidence|Kozlov's evidence]]

